   159	# proved the approval a status asserts actually exists.
   160	#
   161	# GRAMMAR (PROCESS §3 whitelist rule). Measured EMPIRICALLY from all 89
   162	# rows of the real manifest BEFORE enforcing, with zero false rejections
   163	# on genuine data. A cite is one whitespace-free token; inside it every
   164	# occurrence of `.loop/` MUST begin a well-formed artifact reference:
