   168	# <name> is [A-Za-z0-9._{},-]+ and may carry ONE brace group — the
   169	# measured multi-round form `.loop/c6-review-codex-r{1,2,3}.log`, which
   170	# expands to one path per alternative. TOKEN COUNT MUST EQUAL WELL-FORMED
